# A later rule for the same place replaces the earlier one: each battle gets a space, not an x.
rule 7 text x
rule 7 key space
# The retreat menu gets a, and the wait after it (the confirmation at place 5) the rule's second key, y.
rule 14:R text ay
# Any other menu but the main menu: esc.
rule 14 key esc
# Three months: answer by the rules up to the main menu, then end the turn there.
repeat 3
play until 14:M
text e
end
